@startuml
title Deployment: sample-azure infrastructure

actor Browser

node "Azure Static Web App\n(Free tier)" as Swa {
  artifact "public/\n(index.html, app.js)" as FrontendArtifact
  node "Functions API\n(Node.js 24)" as Func {
    artifact "items.ts (compiled)" as ApiArtifact
  }
}

node "Azure SQL Server\n(public network access: Enabled,\nmin TLS 1.2)" as SqlServer {
  database "appdb\n(GP_S_Gen5, free limit, auto-pause)" as Appdb
}

Browser --> FrontendArtifact : HTTPS
FrontendArtifact --> ApiArtifact : fetch /api/items
ApiArtifact --> Appdb : TDS (mssql);\nSQL_SERVER/SQL_DATABASE/\nSQL_USER/SQL_PASSWORD app settings

@enduml
